  "## Landed on default branches

| what | where |
|---|---|
| JVM surface detector (11th orgs-detector) | `scripts/verify-jvm-dependency-surface.cljs` |
| ClojureScript runner-completeness gate (12th) | `scripts/verify-cljs-runner-completeness.cljs` |
| tranche pipeline (3 steps) | `list-portable-runner-candidates` / `sweep-portable-runners` / `land-portable-runners` |
| bb.edn tranche (2 steps) | `measure-bb-to-nbb-yield` / `land-bb-to-nbb` |
| batched pin advance | `scripts/west-pin-put-batch.cljs` |
| `:nbb-test` classpath from `~/.gitlibs` | `scripts/fleet-ci/tick.cljs` |

Repositories changed: **438** (260 runner tranche + 177 bb tranche + nekko), plus 5
runner repos and 3 cloud-itonami actors landed by hand. **Zero landing failures, zero
forced pins.**

